# Apple Design Skill

When reviewing UI/UX designs or writing frontend components, adhere to the Apple Design Guidelines in:
- `.skills/apple-design/SKILL.md` (Main review framework)
- `.skills/apple-design/references/hig-lookup.md` (Topic routing)
- `.skills/apple-design/references/hig/*.md` (53 HIG design documents)

Core focus:
- Minimum 44x44px touch targets
- WCAG AA contrast ratios
- Mathematical border radius nesting: Inner = Outer - Padding
- Liquid glass: backdrop-blur with subtle borders and balanced opacity
- Responsive mobile & desktop typography scales
